[0.000, "o", "\u001b[93m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1;35m@ agent/agent.py:78 @\u001b[0m\u001b[1;38;5;146m or credential changes, and anything outside Cartwheel.\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\nWhen you are unsure, or an action is above your authority (for example a\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\nrefund above the auto-approval threshold), call escalate_to_human and tell\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\nthe user a human will follow up.\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1;32m\u001b[m\u001b[1;32mAccount changes (email"]
[0.001, "o", ", password, payment credentials) always go to a human\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1;32m\u001b[m\u001b[1;32m— call escalate_to_human. Do not just refuse; escalate.\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n## Tone\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\nPlain and warm. No legalese.\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n"]
